title: Airlock
text: Two hatches to each chamber, and no way to walk between them. Whatever gets in has to find its own way out.
trick: a beam can go back into the teleporter it just came out of: travelling a new way it finds a new partner
motif: rooms: a flight of two sealed chambers, each with an outer hatch on two sides
expect: depth>=6
